foreign  [Music]  the data collected in your Erp systems  is highly valuable for making proactive  decisions and predicting business  outcomes  however these systems are extremely  complex and getting data out of them can  be tedious in addition as critical  business processes depend on the Erp  it's important to maintain the system's  performance while extracting data out in  this video we're sharing a seamless way  to bring your data from sap one of the  most prevalent Erp systems into Google  Cloud to serve as a scalable consistent  single source of Truth bring data  together and keep it highly secure  cloud data Fusion is Google Cloud's  Enterprise grade data integration  service for building data warehouses  data lakes and data Marts on bigquery  data Fusion offers the capability to  seamlessly extract data from sap ECC s  for Hana and business warehouse and  business warehouse for Hana and ingest  it into bigquery Google Cloud's data  warehouse solution with data Fusion  users can Wrangle and prepare sap data  join it with other data from  applications public data sets or  databases and then cleanse and load it  into bigquery  once the data is in bigquery you can  apply artificial intelligence and  machine learning to uncover insights and  activate the data to better understand  customers and react to their needs let's  head into the data Fusion UI on the home  page you'll see the services of data  Fusion including Wrangle where you can  cleanse and transform raw data code free  integrate which allows you to visually  design ETL data Pipelines  replicate where you can set your data to  replicate continuously and in real time  from operational data stores  Discovery and govern where you can  explore data lineage and administrative  services to do monitoring and management  of your Pipelines  to integrate with sap data sources data  Fusion supports four plugins  table batch Source odata ODP and SLT  replication  in this demo environment there are a few  sap data pipelines deployed for a  variety of business use cases  for example  a pipeline that loads materials  requirement planning data to help plan  the material and procurement planning  needs of a business  and another pipeline that loads orders  and purchase data to monitor the status  of purchase order lines  these pipelines are using different  plugins depending on the data ingestion  and extraction use cases  for example you could configure bulk  transfers and extractions using table  batch or odata plugins  Delta transfers using the ODP plugin and  more real-time replication using the SLT  plugin  let's look at one of the example  pipelines in detail this pipeline joins  two sap sales order tables vbap and vbac  using the table batch reader the  projection operation is available to  help map sap schema names into more  business understandable names  you can also perform wrangling on the  data directly within the pipeline  next this join our transformation joins  the records of the two tables and then  the pipeline loads the data into  bigquery  click run to start the pipeline  after the pipeline is completed you can  view the transform data that has been  loaded into bigquery  back in the data Fusion UI you can head  to summary to see statistics about the  pipeline lastly data Fusion also  provides sap accelerators which you can  access by clicking to view the Hub  these accelerators are pre-packaged  templates to make your sap pipeline  deployments much easier  you can filter for specific accelerators  based on your use cases like order to  Cache procure to pay or based on plugins  by leveraging these sap Integrations you  can both improve your developer  productivity and accelerate your time to  Value pipeline Studio allows developers  to read from sap code free and to use  pre-built transformations to speed up  data cleaning and preparation once the  sap data is available in bigquery you  can immediately start building ml models  using bqml or utilize other Advanced  capabilities of the Google Cloud  portfolio to gain business insights to  learn more about the data Fusion sap  plugins check out the documentation  Linked In the description below or reach  out to your sales representative if you  have any questions or would like to  discuss how data Fusion can help your  data Journey  foreign  [Music]

